master, not even our madam.

14:10.840 --> 14:12.970
Nobody could save our ojou-san.

14:14.980 --> 14:18.810
Besides, just the fact that she was pregnant
alone was a big deal.

14:19.590 --> 14:24.720
But Ojou-san never revealed the name of the
father, even when she left the house.

14:26.020 --> 14:28.960
Why... Why didn't she tell anyone!?

14:29.190 --> 14:31.660
Of course, she was protecting the guy.

14:31.760 --> 14:35.060
The master was so powerful...

14:36.000 --> 14:39.200
