15:33.630 --> 15:34.960
Actually, it's his fault.

15:34.960 --> 15:35.390
Ugh!

15:35.790 --> 15:39.290
If I hadn't been born, you wouldn't have had
to run away from home.

15:40.030 --> 15:43.400
